; RFC 9942 (COSE Receipts) -- Section 5.2.1, "Receipt of Inclusion"
; Figure 5: "A VDP in an Unprotected Header"
; Source: rfc9942.txt lines 504-513; figure caption at line 515.
;
; Copied VERBATIM, including the RFC's left margin, the blank lines between
; rules, and the absence of commas between group entries.
;
; 3 rules: inclusion-proofs, verifiable-proofs, unprotected-header-map.
;
; This block does NOT compile standalone and does NOT concatenate with the
; rest of the document as written. Preserved defects:
;   * "inclusion-proof" (line 504) is referenced as a type but is defined
;     nowhere; Figure 3 defines "inclusion-proof-content" instead.
;   * "cose-label" (line 512) is defined only in Figure 1.
;   * "cose-value" (line 512, SINGULAR) is defined nowhere in RFC 9942.
;   * "verifiable-proofs" (line 506) collides with the Section 5.3.1 rule
;     of the same name and DIFFERENT body (line 618).
;   * "unprotected-header-map" (line 510) collides with line 622.
; See README.md, "Defects".
;
; -- verbatim extract begins (source line 504) --
   inclusion-proofs = [ + inclusion-proof ]

   verifiable-proofs = {
     &(inclusion-proof: -1) => inclusion-proofs
   }

   unprotected-header-map = {
     &(vdp: 396) => verifiable-proofs
     * cose-label => cose-value
   }
; -- verbatim extract ends (source line 513) --
